From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linker: DT_NEEDED libraries are searched in DT_RUNPATH (else DT_RPATH) first

Android's linker looks a library's DT_NEEDED entries up in its DT_RUNPATH directories before the namespace's search path. This
linker never read DT_RUNPATH: Termux's programs (bash, coreutils) name /data/data/com.termux/files/usr/lib there, their libraries
(libandroid-support.so, libreadline.so.8, libiconv.so) were not found and bash failed to link ("cannot locate symbol libiconv_close").
Absolute directories only ($ORIGIN is not expanded); a library not found there is looked up by name as before. The absolute name
goes through the path layer (apklayer's per-app /data/data/<pkg> view).

apklayer patch 0033 of patches/bionic_translation.
---
diff --git a/linker/linker.c b/linker/linker.c
--- a/linker/linker.c
+++ b/linker/linker.c
@@ -2895,12 +2895,30 @@
 		}
 	}
 
+	/* apklayer patch: DT_RUNPATH (else DT_RPATH) directories first, as Android's linker searches them (Termux's programs name
+	 * /data/data/com.termux/files/usr/lib); absolute ones only, no $ORIGIN */
+	const char *runpath = NULL;
+	for (ElfW(Dyn) *d = si->dynamic; d->d_tag != DT_NULL; d++)
+		if (d->d_tag == DT_RUNPATH || (d->d_tag == DT_RPATH && !runpath))
+			runpath = si->strtab + d->d_un.d_val;
+
 	for (ElfW(Dyn) *d = si->dynamic; d->d_tag != DT_NULL; d++) {
 		if (d->d_tag == DT_NEEDED) {
 			DEBUG("%5d %s needs %s\n", apkenv_pid, si->name, si->strtab + d->d_un.d_val);
 			soinfo *lsi = NULL;
+			const char *needed = si->strtab + d->d_un.d_val;
+			for (const char *dir = runpath; dir && *dir && !lsi && !strchr(needed, '/');) {
+				size_t n = strcspn(dir, ":");
+				char full[512];
+				if (dir[0] == '/' && !memchr(dir, '$', n) && n + strlen(needed) + 2 <= sizeof(full)) {
+					snprintf(full, sizeof(full), "%.*s/%s", (int)n, dir, needed);
+					lsi = apkenv_find_library(full, si->app_ns, false, RTLD_NOW, NULL);
+				}
+				dir += n + (dir[n] == ':');
+			}
 			// if (get_builtin_lib_handle(si->strtab + d->d_un.d_val) == NULL)
-			lsi = apkenv_find_library(si->strtab + d->d_un.d_val, si->app_ns, true, RTLD_NOW, NULL);
+			if (!lsi)
+				lsi = apkenv_find_library(needed, si->app_ns, true, RTLD_NOW, NULL);
 			if (lsi == 0) {
 				/**
 				 * XXX Dirty Hack Alarm --thp XXX
